media: i2c: imx582: add the 8000x6000 mode (48 MP, the sensor's remosaic)

The array without binning, from the first mode of the vendor sensor
module configuration (the one the other tables came from): 32
registers differ from the 4000x3000 mode, binning off and 0x3620/0x3621
set (0 in the binned modes: the sensor's remosaic, inferred).  Link
frequency 592.8 MHz (from its IOP PLL, by the formula that gives the
other two), pixel rate 508.8 MHz, frame 9184 x 6062: about 9.1 fps.
The board's endpoint lists the new link frequency.

Not built or run yet.

